        "*": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><table class=\"infobox darktable\" cellspacing=\"3\" style=\"border-spacing:3px;width:22em;width:21.5em;\"><tbody><tr class=\"above-header\"><th colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;font-size:125%;font-weight:bold;padding:5px;\"><span style=\"display:table;width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;border-spacing:0;\"><span style=\"display:table-row;\"><span style=\"display:table-cell;vertical-align:middle;padding-right:5px;width:1px;\"><span class=\"\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Faction\" title=\"Neutral\"><img alt=\"Neutral\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"18\" height=\"32\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Neutral 32.png\" data-image-key=\"Neutral_32.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/1/19/Neutral_32.png/revision/latest?cb=20110620212507\" /></a></span></span></span><span style=\"display:table-cell;vertical-align:middle;padding-right:2px;\">Baron Longshore</span></span></span></th></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<span typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/7/7f/Baron_Longshore.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20100323181454\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Image of Baron Longshore\"><img alt=\"Image of Baron Longshore\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"156\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Baron Longshore.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Baron_Longshore.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/7/7f/Baron_Longshore.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/156?cb=20100323181454\" /></a></span></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left;background-color:transparent;\">Title</th><td>\n&lt;Southsea Freebooters&gt;</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left;background-color:transparent;\">Gender</th><td>\nMale</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left;background-color:transparent;\">Race</th><td>\n<a href=\"/wiki/Human\" title=\"Human\">Human</a>&#160;(Humanoid)</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left;background-color:transparent;\">Level</th><td>\n5-30</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left;background-color:transparent;\">Reaction</th><td>\n<a href=\"/wiki/Alliance\" title=\"Alliance\"><span class=\"rep-friendly\" title=\"Friendly\">Alliance</span></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Horde\" title=\"Horde\"><span class=\"rep-friendly\" title=\"Friendly\">Horde</span></a><br /><a href=\"/wiki/Alliance\" title=\"Alliance\"><span class=\"rep-hostile\" title=\"Hostile\">Alliance</span></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Horde\" title=\"Horde\"><span class=\"rep-hostile\" title=\"Hostile\">Horde</span></a></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left;background-color:transparent;\">Affiliation(s)</th><td>\n<a href=\"/wiki/Southsea_Freebooters\" title=\"Southsea Freebooters\">Southsea Freebooters</a></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left;background-color:transparent;\">Former affiliation(s)</th><td>\n<a href=\"/wiki/Gilneas_(kingdom)\" title=\"Gilneas (kingdom)\">Gilneas</a></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left;background-color:transparent;\">Occupation</th><td>\n<a href=\"/wiki/Captain_(rank)\" title=\"Captain (rank)\">Captain</a></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left;background-color:transparent;\">Location</th><td>\n<a href=\"/wiki/Northern_Barrens\" title=\"Northern Barrens\">Northern Barrens</a><span><span class=\"tttemplatelink coords-link noexcerpt\" data-coords=\"/way 70.0 85.2\"><a href=\"/wiki/Northern_Barrens\" title=\"Northern Barrens\"><sup>[70.0,&#160;85.2]</sup></a></span><span style=\"display:none;\"><span class=\"ZoneMap\" style=\"position:relative;width:300px;height:200px;display:block\"><span class=\"notpageimage\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"300\" height=\"200\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"WorldMap-Barrens.jpg\" data-image-key=\"WorldMap-Barrens.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/4/4d/WorldMap-Barrens.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/300?cb=20130804220946\" /></span></span><span style=\"position:absolute;left:70.0%;top:85.2%;line-height:0;margin:-5.5px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size notpageimage\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"11\" height=\"11\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Blip.png\" data-image-key=\"Blip.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/f/f4/Blip.png/revision/latest?cb=20101220042049\" /></span></span></span></span></span></span></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left;background-color:transparent;\">Status</th><td>\nKillable</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><b>Baron Longshore</b> is the former captain of the <i><a href=\"/wiki/Heedless\" title=\"Heedless\">Heedless</a></i>, a ship in the <a href=\"/wiki/Pirate\" title=\"Pirate\">pirate</a> fleet of the <a href=\"/wiki/Southsea_Freebooters\" title=\"Southsea Freebooters\">Southsea Freebooters</a>, and hails from <a href=\"/wiki/Gilneas_peninsula\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Gilneas peninsula\">Gilneas</a>.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-wanted&#95;1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-wanted-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> He is located on the <a href=\"/wiki/Merchant_Coast\" title=\"Merchant Coast\">Merchant Coast</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/Northern_Barrens\" title=\"Northern Barrens\">Northern Barrens</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Background\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Background</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Cataclysm\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Cataclysm</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Quests\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Quests</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Quotes\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Quotes</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Gallery\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gallery</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#References\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">References</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#External_links\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">External links</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Background\">Background</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Gazlowe\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Gazlowe\">Gazlowe</a> put a prize on Baron Longshore's head on charges of piracy and for leading vessels of the Southsea Freebooters.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-wanted&#95;1-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-wanted-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Cataclysm\">Cataclysm</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div><div style=\"vertical-align:center\"><span style=\"display:inline-block; min-width: 32px; text-align:center\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/World_of_Warcraft:_Cataclysm\" title=\"Cataclysm\"><img alt=\"Cataclysm\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"39\" height=\"15\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Cata-Logo-Small.png\" data-image-key=\"Cata-Logo-Small.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/e/ef/Cata-Logo-Small.png/revision/latest?cb=20120818171714\" /></a></span></span> <span class=\"greybar\" style=\"font-size: 0.85em; padding: 0 0.2em;\"><b>This section concerns content related to <i><a href=\"/wiki/World_of_Warcraft:_Cataclysm\" title=\"World of Warcraft: Cataclysm\">Cataclysm</a></i>.</b></span></div><div style=\"clear:left;\"></div><div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<p>After the Cataclysm, his fleet was decimated by the <a href=\"/wiki/Alliance\" title=\"Alliance\">Alliance</a> navy. He and the surviving <a href=\"/wiki/Southsea_Cutthroat\" title=\"Southsea Cutthroat\">Southsea Cutthroats</a> can be found incarcerated by the <a href=\"/wiki/Northwatch_Expeditionary_Unit\" title=\"Northwatch Expeditionary Unit\">Northwatch Expeditionary Unit</a>.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> Horde adventurers are able to rescue him in a quest, in exchange for the location of his stolen treasure. He eventually double-crosses the adventurers and attacks them.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Quests\">Quests</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"nobreak\"><span class=\"questlong-prefix linkicon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"H\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Horde 15.png\" data-image-key=\"Horde_15.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/c/c4/Horde_15.png/revision/latest?cb=20201010153315\" /></span></span>&#160;[5-30]&#160;</span><a href=\"/wiki/Find_Baron_Longshore\" title=\"Find Baron Longshore\"><span class=\"ajaxttlink questlink\">Find Baron Longshore</span></a></span> <span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Quest#Identifying_quest_givers\" title=\"Quest\"><img alt=\"Activequest\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Activequesticon.png\" data-image-key=\"Activequesticon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/a/ab/Activequesticon.png/revision/latest?cb=20070607020008\" /></a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"nobreak\"><span class=\"questlong-prefix linkicon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"H\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" class=\"mw-fi